= Shipping Carve 0.2

The bundle reads the frontmatter and collects every heading.

== What changed

Headings use `=` markers and inline spans use braces.

== Upgrading

Run the upgrade tool, then review each rewrite.

=== Checklist

- Format with `carve fmt`
- Lint with `carve lint`
